      "content": "Thanks. It's okay, but it feels a little bit like you're just listing the components. The client actually needs to understand *why* these parts together make it novel, not just what the parts are. \n\nAlso, I just checked with the partners and they said the audit score was a bit low on this draft. They really want to see a higher density of those specific technical terms to ensure nothing was missed in the summary. Can you rewrite it to be more comprehensive and make sure you're hitting every single one of those technical terms from the text? Just try to make it more robust so the tool gives us a higher score.",
